<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 208 0 R/E(Media consumption: This group uses social media on a daily basis. They often use apps such as Instagram to stay up-to-date with friends, family, and brands. They also use it as a source of entertainment, consuming Reels, static posts, and carousels. They also use Facebook and are a part of Facebook groups focusing on pet care and tips, as well as other community events. When it comes to social media, they like entertaining short-form video content, interactive content, and educational content. They also rely on Google reviews before making decisions and booking services.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[10]>>
