345 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 210 0 R/T(Testimonial Tuesday is a biweekly campaign designed to build trust and credibility by highlighting client satisfaction through Google reviews. Each post features a static graphic featuring reviews copied from Google and direct feedback that was sent to us and shared on both Facebook and Instagram. The goal of this campaign is to reinforce AHCC\220s reputation through authentic feedback. )/E(Testimonial Tuesday is a biweekly campaign designed to build trust and credibility by highlighting client satisfaction through Google reviews. Each post features a static graphic featuring reviews copied from Google and direct feedback that was sent to us and shared on both Facebook and Instagram. The goal of this campaign is to reinforce AHCC\220s reputation through authentic feedback. )/Pg 18 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

346 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 210 0 R/E(This campaign has several strengths. The first strength is that it reinforces credibility by sharing authentic client experiences that serve as proof of its excellent services. Sometimes, clients will even double down and comment about their experiences in the comment section of the post. These posts also tend to see high engagement rates on both platforms. Another strength is that it is a biweekly campaign that strengthens brand identity and serves as a familiar touchpoint for the audience to recognize and anticipate. A third strength is that it drives a clear call to action for prospective clients to book appointments, as well as push clients to share their own experiences, whether on Google or on its social media pages. )/Pg 18 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

347 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 210 0 R/T(Previous Campaigns)/E(Previous Campaigns)/Pg 18 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

348 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 210 0 R/T(CAMPAIGN OVERVIEW)/E(CAMPAIGN OVERVIEW)/Pg 18 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

349 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 210 0 R/T(STRENGTHS )/E(STRENGTHS )/Pg 18 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

350 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 210 0 R/E(This campaign also has its weaknesses. First, the campaign can start to feel repetitive because, even though the content is posted biweekly, the overall format remains unchanged, even when different reviews are featured. The posts can also be challenging to directly tie to measurable business goals. Without advanced tracking tools, it is difficult to determine if these posts are attracting new clients or influencing appointment bookings. Ultimately, the campaign primarily focuses on client satisfaction rather than showcasing the full range of services the clinic offers.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

