357 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 211 0 R/T(The Caturday campaign is a new weekly social media campaign that is posted on both Facebook and Instagram and  features AHCC's two office cats, Bravo and Lainey. Both cats live in the hospital and are well-known and loved by clients. Turning them into the official mascots of AHCC gives the clinic a unique identity that stands out from traditional veterinary clinics. )/E(The Caturday campaign is a new weekly social media campaign that is posted on both Facebook and Instagram and  features AHCC's two office cats, Bravo and Lainey. Both cats live in the hospital and are well-known and loved by clients. Turning them into the official mascots of AHCC gives the clinic a unique identity that stands out from traditional veterinary clinics. )/Pg 19 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

358 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 211 0 R/E(The first strength is that the campaign generates high engagement. These posts are often static images featuring Bravo and/or Lainey often receive more likes and comments than other types of content. Another strength is that having clinic cats can set it apart from other veterinary practices by humanizing the brand and making it feel more welcoming. The campaign also allows for entertaining content to be posted. Caturday reinforces AHCC's relatable brand image, strengthening the bond between AHCC and its audience, helping balance out the educational and promotional content the brand posts.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[2]>>
