424 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 216 0 R/E(Introduce Monthly Service Spotlight. This strategy supports Animal HealthCare Center by raising awareness of its full range of services. January will highlight wellness exams and vaccinations, February will emphasize dental cleanings and surgical procedures, and March will focus on parasite prevention and acupuncture. These services will be highlighted through educational posts, client testimonials, and other engaging visuals emphasizing the importance of proactive pet care. This strategy reinforces goal one by increasing awareness about the clinic and directly supports goal two by educating clients about its services.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

425 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 216 0 R/E(Developing strategies and tactics is another important step in this campaign process. These elements help provide AHCC with a clear path for achieving its goals and objectives. Strategies provide the approach to reaching the goals, and tactics are the specific actions that will be taken to bring the strategies to fruition. They work together to ensure the campaign stays focused and organized.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

426 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 216 0 R/T(Campaign Strategies)/E(Campaign Strategies)/Pg 24 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

427 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 216 0 R/T(Strategy 1)/E(Strategy 1)/Pg 24 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

428 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 216 0 R/E(.AHCC can incorporate behind-the-scenes \(BTS\) content featuring its staff, allowing new followers to put a face to a name and allowing all followers, both new and old, to connect with all staff members, including receptionists, technicians, kennel staff, veterinarians, and even the office cats, Bravo and Lainey, on a deeper level. According to Kenan \(2023\), \215behind-the-scenes \(BTS\) content gives a glance into the people behind its favorite products, services, and social content. Behind-the-scenes content humanizes brands, strengthens their online presence, and nurtures customer relationships.\216 This strategy directly supports goal two by building and strengthening client relationships. It also supports goal three by increasing engagement across Facebook and Instagram through the use of personal and relatable content. )/Pg 24 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

429 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 216 0 R/T(Strategy 2)/E(Strategy 2)/Pg 24 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

430 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 216 0 R/E(AHCC can push PetDesk app downloads as part of the Sit, Stay, Be Healthy Campaign. The PetDesk app enables pet owners to schedule appointments, request medications, and access all their pets' medical records in one convenient location, 24/7. PetDesk reports that \21587% of pet owners value receiving useful reminders for appointments and vaccinations, 83% appreciate easily accessing or sharing pet health records, and 78% use the ability to book appointments at any time on any device\216 \(PetDesk, 2025\). Posts will highlight the features such as vaccine reminders, medication refill requests, and quick booking links. This supports goal four by using social media posts to measurable conversions and removing barriers to preventive care. )/Pg 24 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

