<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 218 0 R/Pg 26 0 R/A[763 0 R 0]/K[1]>>
endobj

449 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(AHCC will post monthly engagement initiatives aligned with each month's theme to encourage audience participation and education. January can be centered around starting the year off right with a healthy start. AHCC will encourage clients to prioritize their pets' health in 2026 by scheduling wellness exams and vaccinations. Clients can share a photo or comment on its page about how they plan to keep their pets healthy throughout this upcoming year. Clients who post will be featured on AHCC's social media page. February will be centered around dental and surgical procedures, offering a discount for dental procedures throughout the month in recognition of Pet Dental Health Month. March will focus on parasite prevention and acupuncture through interactive posts on Facebook and Instagram. Its audiences can answer short educational questions to help keep them informed and educated about their pets' health. )/Pg 26 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

450 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 218 0 R/T(Tactic 1)/E(Tactic 1)/Pg 26 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

451 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 218 0 R/T(Campaign Tactics)/E(Campaign Tactics)/Pg 26 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

452 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(AHCC can create a rotating series that consists of short-form content featuring staff members, including veterinarians and the office cats, Bravo and Lainey. This series could include videos such as \215A Day in the Life of an Office Cat\216, \215Meet the Vet\216, or \215Fact or Fiction.\216 This can help humanize the clinic and make AHCC feel more approachable and trustworthy to current and potential clients. By featuring staff members, clients can form a personal connection with the staff and the clinic, which helps build stronger, more meaningful relationships. It also encourages people to engage more with entertaining and authentic content rather than flat promotional content. )/Pg 26 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

453 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(AHCC can incorporate strong call-to-actions \(CTA\) and direct booking links into service-related posts that encourage clients to download and use the PetDesk app. The clinic can highlight all the convenient features of the app and embed the "Download Now" or "Book Now" link option through Meta Business Suite. By doing this, AHCC is driving online bookings by promoting the PetDesk app and encouraging clients to take their pets' health seriously.)/Pg 26 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

