460 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 219 0 R/T(Campaign Theme & Supporting Messaging )/E(Campaign Theme & Supporting Messaging )/Pg 27 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

461 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 219 0 R/E(The Sit, Stay, Be Healthy campaign is based on promoting proactive care and encouraging pet owners to prioritize regular wellness checkups, preventative care, and specialized services, which are all conveniently offered at AHCC. From wellness exams with or without vaccinations, dental cleanings, acupuncture, surgeries, diagnostics, and boarding, AHCC provides the full spectrum of care for your pets. This theme aims to educate clients and encourage them to prioritize their pets' health. This will be done by highlighting the importance of preventive care and making clients aware of the wide range of services offered at AHCC. The clinic wants its clients to understand why veterinary medicine is an ongoing commitment rather than a reactive measure. By emphasizing its services, the campaign positions AHCC as a trusted, full-service veterinary service provider.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

462 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 219 0 R/T("From wellness exams to dental cleanings, surgeries, and acupuncture, our team provides the full spectrum of care for your pet\220s needs.")/E("From wellness exams to dental cleanings, surgeries, and acupuncture, our team provides the full spectrum of care for your pet\220s needs.")/Pg 27 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

463 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 219 0 R/E(This message aims to increase the awareness of AHCC's comprehensive range of services and build trust within the community. It educates clients about services from basic wellness check-ups to advanced medical care, showcasing the convenience of choosing a full-service veterinary provider rather than one that refers clients to other places for their pets' needs.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

464 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 219 0 R/T("Schedule your next appointment with ease, book anytime, anywhere, 24/7 through our online booking service.")/E("Schedule your next appointment with ease, book anytime, anywhere, 24/7 through our online booking service.")/Pg 27 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

465 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 219 0 R/E(This message emphasizes AHCC's commitment to convenience by reminding clients of its online booking tools through its website and the PetDesk app. The clinic aims to reduce barriers to booking appointments by promoting flexibility and accessibility for every client. Since starting online booking, the clinic has already seen a slight uptick in appointments made, and a significant amount of them are made during out-of-office hours \(Vetstoria, n.d.\), demonstrating the convenience of being able to book appointments that fit their schedule.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

466 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 219 0 R/T("We understand they are more than just pets, they're family.")/E("We understand they are more than just pets, they're family.")/Pg 27 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

467 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 219 0 R/E(This message reflects AHCC's commitment to compassionate and trusted care. It reinforces the clinic's dedication to treating every pet with the same love and respect as their own. We aim to build lasting relationships with its clients, making a positive lasting impression every time they walk through the door.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

