476 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 220 0 R/E(This post promotes one of AHCC's February initiatives, National Pet Dental Health Month. It clearly supports the campaign by promoting proactive pet care, increasing service awareness, and driving appointment bookings through timely and engaging content.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

477 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 220 0 R/E(This is a cover for a The Day in The Life video. This type of behind-the-scences content allows AHCC to create authentic and engaging content that showcases the work of its veterinarians. Showing what the doctor's do day-to-day gives clients an inside look at what the veteriary team does and the hard work that goes each and every appointment. It aligns well with its goals such as creating more video content, building trust and credibility within the community and inreasing engagement across its social media pages.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

