510 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 224 0 R/E(The Sit, Stay, Be Healthy campaign will utilize a total budget of around $3,500. Since AHCC is a smaller, locally owned clinic, the budget is modest but realistic for its marketing goals. The budget will be divided into five smaller parts to ensure we meet the campaign goals. Paid social media ads will be managed through Meta Business Suite to boost Instagram and Facebook posts, increasing visibility, engagement, and appointment bookings. Creative production is another cost that the clinic will incur. Photography, video, and graphic design tools such as Canva Pro and Capcut Premium will be used to ensure band consistency across all platforms. Printed materials with online booking information will be used for display and to give to clients at the end of their appointment. This approach encourages repeat engagement and fulfills one of the campaign's goals. Promotions such as the 10% off dental procedures must also be worked into the budget. Finally, Analytics and reporting tools such as Sprout Social track engagement, impressions, content performance, and overall campaign effectiveness across platforms.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

511 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 224 0 R/E(The main concern with this budget is balancing advertising and creative costs, especially when promoting a new service. Because the acupuncture service will still be new, it may require more promotion than parasite prevention or surgical procedures. To help offset the cost of photography and video creation, AHCC will utilize in-house content creation featuring pets visiting the clinic for appointments, while also producing authentic and engaging content.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

