1288 0 obj
<</Title(The Animal HealthCare Center\220s \215Sit, Stay, Be Healthy\216 campaign will launch on January 1st, 2026, and run through March 31st, 2026. The campaign will begin at the start of the year because, according to Faraci \(2024\), \215January gives us a clean slate and can make us more optimistic about its ability to change and more motivated to take action.\216 This three-month campaign allows Animal HealthCare Center \(AHCC\) to build strong awareness around the clinic\220s preventative and specialized services. Each month in the campaign will feature two services that AHCC offers to educate clients and strengthen awareness of its full range of care.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1282 0 R>>
endobj

