1294 0 obj
<</Title(One major pro to this campaign is that it aligns with monthly awareness themes that naturally support AHCC's services. January capitalizes on the new year motivation and aligns with the idea of starting the year off on a healthy foot. February ties into two national month themes: National Pet Dental Health Month and Spay/Neuter Awareness Month, allowing AHCC to promote both dental and surgical procedures strongly. March also ties into a monthly theme with World Parasite Day on March 20th. One potential con to this campaign is that promoting two services in one month could make it difficult to promote each service equally and fully address the campaign's goals.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1289 0 R>>
endobj

