1339 0 obj
<</Title(Healing Arts Veterinary Center is a veterinary office that combines both traditional and alternative therapies to provide a full range of services for both standard and specialized services. In addition to general veterinary offerings such as surgery, diagnostics, radiology, dentistry, and emergency care, the clinic distinguishes itself with unique services, including non-anesthetic dental sessions, Class IV laser therapy, and canine rehabilitation programs that utilize underwater treadmills and therapy pools. These services position Healing Arts as a clinic that clients can turn to when seeking specialized treatments and pain management options. On social media, Healing Arts is only active on Facebook, and it exclusively posts pictures of its clients' pets as well as shares some lost pet fliers. It doesn\220t highlight any of its services or any educational content. While this does build a community, the lack of content diversity limits its ability to reach new audiences and engage users beyond its existing client base. Animal HealthCare Center, in comparison, has both community-driven content and educational content on two different social media platforms. This not only allows it to engage in a fun way, but also showcases its services and expertise.)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1330 0 R/Next 1349 0 R>>
endobj

