1347 0 obj
<</Title(Mindful Veterinary Clinic is located just down the road from Animal HealthCare Center. This clinic aims to position itself as the go-to holistic and preventive animal clinic, emphasizing its fear-free wellness care. On social media, Mindful Veterinary Care maintains an active presence on both Facebook and Instagram, where it sometimes features behind-the-scenes and staff features but heavily relies on educational content. This mix of content helps establish trust within its audience base, while also establishing the leader in wellness-focused veterinary medicine. While the educational content reinforces credibility, it narrows down the brand's content scope. The lack of playful, community-driven content may not effectively engage its audience. The Animal HealthCare Center already strikes a balance between educational and entertaining content through its current postings. It can integrate more video content, build a stronger and broader community, and differentiate itself further from Mindful Veterinary Clinic.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1338 0 R/Next 1354 0 R>>
endobj

