<</Title(Testimonial Tuesday is a biweekly campaign designed to build trust and credibility by highlighting client satisfaction through Google reviews. Each post features a static graphic featuring reviews copied from Google and direct feedback that was sent to us and shared on both Facebook and Instagram. The goal of this campaign is to reinforce AHCC\220s reputation through authentic feedback.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1344 0 R>>
endobj

