<</Title(The Caturday campaign is a new weekly social media campaign that is posted on both Facebook and Instagram and  features AHCC's two office cats, Bravo and Lainey. Both cats live in the hospital and are well-known and loved by clients. Turning them into the official mascots of AHCC gives the clinic a unique identity that stands out from traditional veterinary clinics.)/Dest[19 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1353 0 R>>
